# C-c preparation driver independent static review — freeze 01

Specification verdict: **FAIL**. Quality verdict: **CHANGES REQUIRED**.

Execution is not permitted for this freeze. Resolve I1 and M1 and retain the corrected bytes for a bounded re-review. This review concerns actual preparation only; a complete actual package will still require independent artifact/launch review and a separate fresh user paid grant.

